  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Moored Sediment Trap Data - Station P, 1982-1999",
  "description": "Time series sediment trap data from 1982-1999 from traps moored at Ocean Station Papa , at one intermediate station (Station C, 1984-1990) and at 4 stations along Line P, from 200, 1000, and 3800m depths.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Studying the biogeochemical flux at ocean station papa.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Custodian will be leaving soon and has a large quantity of data not secured in a regional data centre. Risk of Loss: High Impact Justification: Long term time series (more than 10 years) Impact of Loss: High Recommended Action: Bring data to archives Additional Info: Station P4 is at La Perouse.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23570770",
