  "temporalCoverage": "1982/1999",
  "measurementTechnique": "Logical consistency: For C:N, biogenic silicate, CaCO3: subsamples of one sample, collected at P26, are analyzed with each set of data to check for continuity. Zooplankton that likely swam into the trap are removed. Silicate concentrations are compared to prepared standards.\n\nCompleteness: Dataset Complications: Many gaps in the data due to malfunctioning equipment or difficulty retrieving the traps. Traps were deployed at stations P12, P16, and P20 from 1995-1998 only.\n\nProcessing step (1992): Unknown",
  "usageInfo": {
    "@type": "CreativeWork",
    "name": "Use and access constraints (from the FGDC record; no license is granted)",
    "text": "Use constraints: Data before 1994 have been published and can be released. Data after 1994 have not been released. Fe/Al/Cd data have not been quality checked, and therefore are not to be released. Access constraints: May Be Private Distribution liability: [unknown]"
  },
