  "citation": "Publications: Wong, C.S., F.A. Whitney, D.W. Crawford, K. Iseki, R.J. Matear, W.K. Johnson, J.S. Page, D. Timothy. 1999. Seasonal and interannual variability inparticle fluxes of carbon, nitrogen, and silicon from time series of sediment traps at Ocean Station P, 1982-1993: relationship to changes in subarctic primary productivity. Deep-Sea Research II 46: 2735-2760."
